<% layout('layouts/boilerplate') %>
<main class="pv-wrap pv-discovery-page"><header class="pv-page-heading"><p class="pv-eyebrow">Scout · Flight &amp; transport discovery</p><h1>Find your flight.<br>Plan how your pet travels.</h1><p class="pv-lead">Start with passenger flights, then confirm whether your pet can travel with you or needs separate transport.</p><%- include('../partials/petPhotoAccent',{photo:'babies.jpg',photoAlt:'A tan dog and a gray-and-white dog resting together on a sandy beach',photoWidth:1600,photoHeight:1273,message:'Plan the route. Keep the companions in mind.',photoNote:'An original photo from the PetVoyage family album.'}) %></header>
<p><a class="pv-button" href="/flights/searchFlights?legacy=1">Use my location / find nearby airports →</a></p><p class="pv-fine-print">Opens our map-based Airport route finder. If you allow browser location access, precise location can be sent to Google Maps. Manual entry is also available; this page does not detect your location.</p><% if(typeof validationError!=='undefined' && validationError){ %><p role="alert" class="pv-note"><%= validationError %></p><% } %><p class="pv-fine-print">Pet origin/residence history and your actual departure airport are different details. The location finder does not change your selected pet origin.</p><form class="pv-discovery-form" method="get" action="/flights/searchFlights"><div class="pv-discovery-fields"><label for="discovery-origin">Pet’s origin country<input id="discovery-origin" name="origin" value="<%= search.origin || '' %>" placeholder="e.g. United States" required maxlength="100"></label><label for="discovery-destination">Destination country<input id="discovery-destination" name="destination" value="<%= search.destination || '' %>" placeholder="e.g. Australia" required maxlength="100"></label><label for="discovery-pet">Your companion<select id="discovery-pet" name="petType"><% [['dog','Dog · ordinary pet'],['cat','Cat'],['bird','Bird'],['other','Other pet'],['assistance','Assistance dog · separate assessment']].forEach(([value,label])=>{ %><option value="<%= value %>" <%= search.petType===value?'selected':'' %>><%= label %></option><% }) %></select></label><label for="discovery-airport">Departure airport (optional)<input id="discovery-airport" name="departureAirport" maxlength="3" pattern="[A-Za-z]{3}" value="<%= search.departureAirport || '' %>" placeholder="e.g. LAX"></label><label for="discovery-city">Departure city<input id="discovery-city" name="departureCity" value="<%= search.departureCity || '' %>" placeholder="Your actual departure city" maxlength="100" required></label><label for="discovery-date">Departure date (optional)<input type="date" id="discovery-date" name="departureDate" value="<%= search.departureDate || '' %>"></label><label for="discovery-return">Return date (optional)<input type="date" id="discovery-return" name="returnDate" value="<%= search.returnDate || '' %>"></label></div><label class="pv-manual-confirm"><input type="checkbox" name="departureConfirmed" value="true" <%= search.departureConfirmed?'checked':'' %> required> I checked the departure country, city and airport; these are my manual entries.</label><label class="pv-manual-confirm"><input type="checkbox" name="departureMismatchConfirmed" value="true" <%= search.departureMismatchConfirmed?'checked':'' %>> An airport in a different country from my origin is intentional, if applicable.</label><button class="pv-button" type="submit">Explore transport options →</button><p class="pv-fine-print">Reviewed research and external search links. No live flight API, AI generation, availability, prices or pet-space checks.</p></form>
<% if(discovery){ %><%- include('../partials/transportDiscovery',{discovery}) %><% }else{ %><section class="pv-note"><h2>Start with a reviewed example</h2><p>Current coverage is deliberately small. Try the ordinary-pet dog U.S. → Australia enquiry example; other combinations clearly show when research is missing.</p><a href="/flights/searchFlights?origin=United%20States&amp;destination=Australia&amp;petType=dog&amp;departureAirport=LAX&amp;departureCity=Los%20Angeles&amp;departureConfirmed=true">Explore the reviewed example →</a></section><% } %>
<section class="pv-note"><h2>Airport route finder</h2><p>Prefer the existing map and airline-route tools? They remain available. Route lists are not fares or confirmed pet acceptance.</p><a href="/flights/searchFlights?legacy=1">Open Airport route finder →</a></section></main>
